---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service - Conditions of Use & User Agreement | MahaSandhi" 
  description="Comprehensive Terms of Service for MahaSandhi (mahasandhi.in). Review our usage rules, intellectual property rights, user obligations, and legal conditions for browsing job updates and educational content."
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-10 px-4 sm:px-6">
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <header class="mb-10 text-center sm:text-left border-b border-border-card pb-8">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        📜 User Terms & Agreement
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-text-main mb-4">
        Terms of <span class="gradient-text">Service</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        Welcome to <strong class="text-text-main">MahaSandhi</strong> (<a href="https://mahasandhi.in" class="text-primary hover:underline font-medium">mahasandhi.in</a>). These Terms of Service govern your access to and use of our website, features, content, and interactive educational tools.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4 text-xs text-text-muted/80 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <span>📅 <strong>Last Updated:</strong> July 23, 2026</span>
        <span>🌐 <strong>Domain:</strong> mahasandhi.in</span>
        <span>📧 <strong>Contact:</strong> hello@mahasandhi.in</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Key Rules Box -->
    <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-main mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
        💡 Key Takeaways for Users
      </h2>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm text-text-muted">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-primary font-bold">•</span>
          <span>MahaSandhi provides <strong>free, informational</strong> updates on government recruitments and study guides.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-primary font-bold">•</span>
          <span>By accessing this site, you agree to comply with all applicable local and national laws.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-primary font-bold">•</span>
          <span>Automated data scraping, malicious attacks, and spam submissions are strictly prohibited.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-primary font-bold">•</span>
          <span>Always verify recruitment notifications on official government portals before applying.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-md sm:prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-text-muted leading-relaxed space-y-10">

      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          1. Acceptance of Terms
        </h2>
        <p>
          By browsing, accessing, or using <strong class="text-text-main">mahasandhi.in</strong>, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service, along with our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-primary hover:underline font-medium">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/disclaimer" class="text-primary hover:underline font-medium">Disclaimer</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you do not agree to these terms in their entirety, you must immediately discontinue your use of this website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          2. Description of Portal Services
        </h2>
        <p>
          MahaSandhi operates as a digital informational gateway providing job aspirants, students, and citizens with:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-sm sm:text-base">
          <li>Summarized updates regarding Maharashtra State (MPSC, WRD, ZP, Police Bharti) and All-India (UPSC, SSC, Banking, Railways) government job notifications.</li>
          <li>Direct access links to official recruitment portals, hall ticket downloads, and result declarations.</li>
          <li>Syllabus breakdowns, study notes (e.g., MPSC Polity series), and exam preparation resources.</li>
          <li>Online utility calculators (Age Calculator, SGPA to CGPA Converter).</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm italic mt-2">
          MahaSandhi reserves the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any feature, article, or tool on the website at any time without prior notice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          3. Permitted & Personal Use
        </h2>
        <p>
          You are granted a non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to access and view the contents of <strong class="text-text-main">mahasandhi.in</strong> strictly for your personal, non-commercial educational and informational use.
        </p>
        <p>
          You may print or share individual articles and notification summaries for personal reference, provided that you retain all original attribution, copyright notices, and website links pointing back to <strong class="text-text-main">mahasandhi.in</strong>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          4. Prohibited Conduct & Activities
        </h2>
        <p>
          When using MahaSandhi, you agree <strong>NOT</strong> to engage in any of the following activities:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base">
          <li><strong>Data Mining & Scraping:</strong> Using automated bots, web scrapers, spiders, or data extraction scripts to scrape articles, job listings, or code from mahasandhi.in without prior written consent.</li>
          <li><strong>Malicious Attacks:</strong> Attempting to disrupt, disable, overburden, or impair site performance, server hosting, or security protocols (including DDoS attacks).</li>
          <li><strong>Form Misuse & Spam:</strong> Submitting false information, spam messages, or malicious payload code via our contact forms or interactive inputs.</li>
          <li><strong>Unauthorized Re-publication:</strong> Copying entire articles, database listings, or code structures to populate competing commercial websites without explicit authorization.</li>
          <li><strong>Misrepresentation:</strong> Pretending to represent MahaSandhi, its administrators, or any government commission.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          5. Intellectual Property Rights
        </h2>
        <p>
          Unless otherwise explicitly stated, all original content, website design, text layout, custom graphics, component architecture, calculators, and software code on <strong class="text-text-main">mahasandhi.in</strong> are the exclusive intellectual property of MahaSandhi and are protected by applicable copyright, trademark, and intellectual property laws.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm">
          Third-party trademarks, government commission logos, and department names mentioned on the site remain the property of their respective owners. Their inclusion does not imply ownership by MahaSandhi.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          6. User Submissions & Feedback
        </h2>
        <p>
          Any feedback, suggestions, questions, or ideas submitted to MahaSandhi via our Contact Us form or email shall become non-confidential and the sole property of MahaSandhi. We reserve the right to use such feedback for website improvements, bug fixes, or user support without restriction or financial compensation.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          7. Disclaimer of Warranties ("As-Is" Basis)
        </h2>
        <p>
          <strong class="text-text-main">MahaSandhi (mahasandhi.in)</strong> is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind, either express or implied, including but not limited to implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not guarantee that the website will operate uninterrupted, error-free, secure from computer viruses, or that any content inaccuracies will be corrected immediately.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 8 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          8. Limitation of Liability & Indemnification
        </h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, in no event shall MahaSandhi, its operators, employees, or content contributors be liable for any direct, indirect, special, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from your use of or inability to use this website.
        </p>
        <p>
          You agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless MahaSandhi and its team from and against any claims, liabilities, damages, losses, costs, or expenses (including reasonable legal fees) arising from your breach of these Terms of Service or your violation of any third-party rights.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 9 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          9. Governing Law & Jurisdiction
        </h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service and any disputes or claims arising out of or in connection with them shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India.
        </p>
        <p>
          You agree that any legal action, suit, or proceeding arising out of these terms shall be instituted exclusively in the competent courts located within the State of Maharashtra, India.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 10 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          10. Changes to Terms of Service
        </h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to revise or update these Terms of Service at our sole discretion at any time. Any changes will become effective immediately upon posting to this page with an updated "Last Updated" revision date. Your continued use of <strong class="text-text-main">mahasandhi.in</strong> following the posting of changes constitutes acceptance of those revisions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 11 -->
      <section class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 mt-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-main mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          11. Contact & Legal Inquiries
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base mb-4">
          If you have any questions, legal inquiries, or concerns regarding these Terms of Service, please reach out to us:
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-text-main font-medium">
          <p>📧 <strong>Legal Contact Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hello@mahasandhi.in" class="text-primary hover:underline font-bold">hello@mahasandhi.in</a></p>
          <p>🌐 <strong>Domain Website:</strong> <a href="https://mahasandhi.in" class="text-primary hover:underline font-bold">mahasandhi.in</a></p>
          <p>📬 <strong>Contact Form:</strong> <a href="/contact-us" class="text-primary hover:underline">Contact MahaSandhi Team</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
